The first escalation also solved 3/3, and the 48-layer rung is currently 2/2 solved. The family’s affine structure is more model-readable than the cheap attack panel suggested; I’m letting the mandated escalation budget finish before deciding whether this is a valid higher rung, a budget-bound park, or a genuine rejection.
