Hard was solved 3/3 again, and the 40-layer escalation is already solved on its first attempt. Nothing in the rerun contradicts the endpoint-attack failure; I’m waiting for the harness to finish and write the authoritative `too_easy` metadata.
diff --git a/gen_1204_4298.py b/gen_1204_4298.py
